---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
import mascotImg from '../assets/mascot.png';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`소개 - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article class="about-content">
				<div class="about-hero">
					<Image src={mascotImg} alt="K잇핏" class="about-mascot" />
					<div>
						<h1>🪄 안녕하세요, K잇핏입니다</h1>
						<p class="about-tagline">똑똑한 소비를 위한 모든 것</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="about-card-item">
					<p>K잇핏은 <strong>똑똑한 소비</strong>를 돕기 위해 만들어졌어요. IT 기기부터 맛집, 자동차, 뷰티, 생활용품까지 카테고리 가리지 않고 솔직하게 알려드려요.</p>
					<p>광고성 정보는 No, 실제 경험과 솔직한 비교는 Yes!</p>
				</div>

				<h2>이 블로그에서 볼 수 있는 것</h2>
				<div class="feature-grid">
					<div class="feature-item">
						<span class="feature-icon">💻</span>
						<h3>IT 기기 리뷰</h3>
						<p>노트북, 스마트폰, 태블릿 등</p>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-item">
						<span class="feature-icon">🍽️</span>
						<h3>K로컬잇슐랭가이드</h3>
						<p>전국 맛집 탐방</p>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-item">
						<span class="feature-icon">🚗</span>
						<h3>자동차 & 테크</h3>
						<p>신차 정보, IT 트렌드</p>
					</div>
					<div class="feature-item">
						<span class="feature-icon">💰</span>
						<h3>가성비 추천</h3>
						<p>예산별 최고의 선택</p>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="about-card-item contact-card">
					<h2>📬 문의</h2>
					<p>제품 협찬, 리뷰 문의, 기타 연락은 아래 메일로 부탁드립니다.</p>
					<p><a href="mailto:contact@kitfit.kr">contact@k-itfit.kr</a></p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>
<style>
	.about-content {
		max-width: 680px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2em 0;
	}
	.about-hero {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 2em;
		background: var(--primary);
		border-radius: 20px;
		padding: 2em;
		margin-bottom: 2em;
	}
	.about-mascot {
		width: 120px;
		height: 120px;
		object-fit: contain;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		border-radius: 50%;
		border: 3px solid white;
		background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
		padding: 3px;
	}
	.about-hero h1 {
		color: white;
		margin: 0 0 0.3em;
		font-size: 1.5em;
	}
	.about-tagline {
		color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 0.95em;
	}
	.about-card-item {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 1.5em;
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
		box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
		border: 1px solid var(--accent-light);
	}
	.about-card-item p {
		margin: 0 0 0.8em;
		color: rgb(var(--gray-dark));
		font-size: 0.95em;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}
	.about-card-item p:last-child { margin: 0; }
	.about-content h2 {
		color: var(--primary-dark);
		font-size: 1.2em;
		margin: 1.5em 0 1em;
	}
	.feature-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
		gap: 1em;
		margin-bottom: 1.5em;
	}
	.feature-item {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 16px;
		padding: 1.5em;
		box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
		border: 1px solid var(--accent-light);
		text-align: center;
	}
	.feature-icon {
		font-size: 2em;
		display: block;
		margin-bottom: 0.3em;
	}
	.feature-item h3 {
		font-size: 1em;
		margin: 0 0 0.3em;
		color: rgb(var(--black));
	}
	.feature-item p {
		font-size: 0.85em;
		color: rgb(var(--gray));
		margin: 0;
	}
	.contact-card {
		background: var(--primary-light);
		border: none;
	}
	.contact-card a {
		color: var(--primary-dark);
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.about-hero { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
	}
</style>
